-- 0133 - three KPI-loop bell kinds join both kind lists: `kpi-allocation-waiting`,
-- `kpi-counter-proposed`, `kpi-month-unclosed` (ADR 0112 §C; 0132's fifty-seven
-- plus three: sixty). No new subject kind, so `notification_subject_kind_known`
-- is untouched.
--
-- Each list is 0132's, copied word for word, plus the three: rebuilding from an
-- older list drops kinds silently (0115's header) or revives the two 0130
-- retired. Widening only: every row 0132 accepted still passes. No policy row
-- is seeded (0106).
-- ORDER: migrate BEFORE deploy; the old build never writes the new kinds.
-- Re-runnable: DROP ... IF EXISTS.
--
-- Hand-written for 0047's reason: `generate`'s baseline is still stuck at 0026.
